@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About CineBook";
}
<main class="container simple-page">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE STORY BEHIND THE SCREEN</div>
    <h1>About <span>CineBook.</span></h1>
    <p>CineBook is a student-built movie discovery and ticket-booking demo made with ASP.NET Core MVC. It showcases a responsive interface, movie filtering, detail dialogs, and sample showtimes.</p>
    <div class="privacy-note"><strong>Demo notice</strong><p>Movie details, ratings, showtimes, and prices displayed here are sample content. This frontend does not create real reservations or process payments. Booking and database features can be connected in the next development stage.</p></div>
    <a class="btn-cinema btn-cinema-primary" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Back to discover <span>↗</span></a>
</main>
